  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      420.48,
      310.09,
      478.55
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisiton(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/servitude which is required for apublic purpose mentioned below.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      79.92,
      492.48,
      237.04,
      502.55
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      516.48,
      310.21,
      574.55
    ],
    "text": "Allotments of lands bearing Lot 01 (extent : 0.8215 Hec.)depicted in the preliminary survey plan bearing No. MR/2586,situated in the village of Naotunna, Grama Niladari Division ofNaotunna in Divisional Secretary's Division of Devinuwara,Matara District, Southern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      588.48,
      309.87,
      622.55
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01Name of land: Kandagehena; Description: Home Garden, 7coconut trees aged about 30-40 years, 1 mango tree aged",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      326.16,
      562.04,
      360.23
    ],
    "text": "about 10-15 years, 3 teak trees aged about 10 years, 1 teak treeaged about 15-20 years, 1 jak tree aged about 10-15 years andcultivation of mixed crop; Extent: 0.8215 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      374.16,
      561.94,
      484.07
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid Land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally or by agent duly authorized in writing, before meat Divisional Secretariat of Devinuwara on the 15.12.2017 at10.00 a.m and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing(in duplicate) on or before the 29.11.2017 the nature of theirinterests in the land, the particulars of their claims forcompensation for the acquisition of the said land/Servitude,the amount of compensation and the details of the computationof such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
